  m_text: 'During <i>CASCADE</i>, if a player does not make a new connection with
    their move,

    that player loses the game! Their symbols remain on the board
    and play continues. If only one player remains, they win!

    If there are no
    more valid players for the current player, the previous player to make a valid
    connection wins'
